---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Black Bars — Hot-Rolled & Forged" active="/products">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Wire Rods · Black & Forged Bars · Billets & Blooms" title="Black Bars" description="Mukand-authorised black bars, forged bars, wire rods, billets and blooms in 200, 300 and 400 series — ultrasonically checked and export-packed." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container layout-2col">
      <div class="prose">
<h3>Rods & bars — black</h3>
<p>Bhansali Metals has mastered demanding operations such as cold working (drawing) on standard machines and continuous lines, in all standard dimensions to international standards — with special attention to harder alloys, stress-free states, free-cutting alloys and blanks.</p>
<p>The black bars are hot-formed with surface scale, majorly used in welding applications. Our precision quality bars are known for best machinability from an advanced production line holding consistent mechanical and chemical properties per customer requirement. All black round bars are ultrasonically checked for flaws and packed on distance-ring equipment in plywood boxes.</p>
<h3>Size range</h3>
        <div class="details">
        <div>
          <b>Wire rods (black), annealed & pickled</b>
          <span>5.5 mm to 23 mm</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Bars</b>
          <span>25 mm to 150 mm</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Forged bars</b>
          <span>60 mm to 400 mm</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Billets</b>
          <span>63, 75, 80, 95, 100 & 125 mm</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Blooms</b>
          <span>125×125, 160×160 & 250×250 mm</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <b>Grades</b>
          <span>AISI 201, 201Cu, 202, 204Cu, 303, 304, 304L, 316, 316L, 316Ti, 317LN, 310S, 321, 347, 347H, 410, 416, 420, 420B, 409Ti, 430, 430L, 430F, 430F DIN, 431, 17-4PH, 2205 (F60), 31803 (F51), 32750 (F53), 32760 (F55), Inconel 625, Inconel 825, Monel K-500, Monel R-405, Monel 400, Monel 401, Monel 404, Hastelloy C276</span>
        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
